OL,5,G0000 Killer on the Run
OL,6,     FThis exclusive true-crime
OL,7,     Fdocumentary tells the story of
OL,8,     FEric Frein, who shot two
OL,9,     FPennsylvania State Troopers
OL,10,     Foutside their barracks in 2014,
OL,11,     Fevading capture for 48 days.
OL,12,G0100 Sleeping with My Murderer
OL,13,     FWithin two years of meeting
OL,14,     FCordelia Farrell, Wayne Coventry
OL,15,     Fdials 999, pleading for help.
OL,16,     FDespite warnings of friends and
OL,17,     Ffamily, he stays with her - a
OL,18,     Fdecision that will cost him dear.
OL,19,     F(Ep5)
